OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies after single-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has died after a
OL,7,Fsingle-vehicle collision in
OL,8,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said a white BMW
OL,11,F218i was travelling towards Stoke
OL,12,FPoges, along Windsor Road, in Gerrards
OL,13,FCross, when it left the carriageway at
OL,14,Fabout 02:50 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FPolice said the driver, a 19-year-old
OL,17,Fman, had died and his next of kin had
OL,18,Fbeen informed.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
